# SleepKnight8 Themes

A reusable theme library for SleepKnight8 projects.

## Themes

* 🟡 Yellow
* 🟣 Purple

## Use

Add this to your HTML `<head>`:

```html
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/SleepKnight8/SleepKnight8_Themes/themes.css">
```

Add this before your project's JavaScript:

```html
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/SleepKnight8/SleepKnight8_Themes/themes.js"></script>
<script src="index.js"></script>
```

## Theme Buttons

```html
<button onclick="setTheme('yellow')">🟡</button>
<button onclick="setTheme('purple')">🟣</button>
```

## Project Structure

You only need your own files:

```text
MyProject/
├── index.html
├── style.css
└── index.js
```

You **do not need to copy** `themes.css` or `themes.js`.

Create your own layout and use `style.css` for project-specific design.

The SleepKnight8 theme library handles the overall appearance.

